    "ios_s3_pairing": "<strong>Pairing file:</strong><br />• <strong>iOS 27:</strong> leave “Import pairing file” <em>empty</em> and install directly.<br />• <strong>iOS 18–26:</strong> you must import a pairing file first — <a class=\"inline-link\" href=\"#ios-pairing\">generate it on a PC (once)</a>, then Import in SideInstaller, then Install.",
    "ios_pairing_how": "<strong>How to make a pairing file (if needed — iOS 18–26):</strong><br />1. On a computer, download <strong>iDevicePair</strong> from the official SideStore docs: <a class=\"inline-link\" href=\"https://docs.sidestore.io/docs/advanced/pairing-file\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">docs.sidestore.io — Pairing File</a> (or tap <em>How do I make one?</em> inside SideInstaller).<br />2. Connect iPhone via USB → Trust → open iDevicePair → Generate. Trust again on the phone if asked.<br />3. Transfer the <code>.mobiledevicepairing</code> file to iPhone.<br />4. In SideInstaller → <strong>Import pairing file</strong> → select it → then Install SideStore.<br />Only needed once. On <strong>iOS 27</strong> you normally skip this.",
    "ios_s4_title": "Developer Mode & Missing Fix",
    "ios_s4_desc": "To run sideloaded developer apps on iOS 16+, Apple requires Developer Mode.<br />1. Open <strong>Settings → Privacy & Security</strong>.<br />2. Scroll to the bottom and tap <strong>Developer Mode</strong> → toggle <strong>ON</strong>.<br />3. Restart your iPhone when prompted, then confirm with your passcode.",
    "ios_s5_title": "Download & Import SideStore.ipa",
    "ios_s5_desc": "1. Tap either download link below in Safari and save SideStore.ipa to the <strong>Files</strong> app.<br />2. Open <strong>SideInstaller</strong> (ensure <strong>Tunnel connected</strong> is green).<br />3. Sign in with your Apple ID (your main account is completely safe; or a spare secondary account if you have one).<br />4. Tap <strong>Import IPA</strong> (or 'Install from file') and select the SideStore.ipa you downloaded.<br />5. <em>iOS 27:</em> leave pairing file empty → tap Install.<br />• <em>iOS 18–26:</em> tap Import Pairing File first → select your pairing file → tap Install.<br />6. Wait until SideStore finishes installing onto your Home Screen.",
