    "fix_title": "Fixes & Troubleshooting",
    "fix_sub": "Most common issues and real solutions from helpers",
    "fix_online_h": "Online — Communication / Connection error",
    "faq_on1_q": "1. Play Protect blocked the install",
    "faq_on1_a": "During installation you must press More info / Show more → Install anyway. If you skipped this, uninstall and reinstall correctly.",
    "faq_on2_q": "2. Antivirus / Firewall / Private DNS",
    "faq_on2_a": "Turn off antivirus, firewall and Private DNS temporarily. These often block the connection to the private server.",
    "faq_on3_q": "3. VPN needed (Europe recommended)",
    "faq_on3_a": "Some regions need a VPN. European servers are recommended. Connect to an EU location and try again.",
    "faq_on_stuck_q": "Stuck on Loading Screen or Connection Error (100% Proven VPN Fix)",
    "faq_on_stuck_a": "A connection error or loading hang is caused by mobile carrier / ISP routing blocks to the private server.<br /><br /><strong>100% Guaranteed Fix with Free VPN (First Time Only):</strong><br />1. Download a free VPN such as <strong>Proton VPN</strong> (Play Store / App Store).<br />2. Connect to a server in <strong>Netherlands</strong>, <strong>USA</strong>, or <strong>Japan</strong>.<br />3. Launch the game with the VPN connected until you reach the main menu / lobby.<br />4. Exit the game, <strong>disconnect the VPN</strong>, and reopen the game.<br /><br /><em>Crucial Note:</em> You only need the VPN the <strong>first time</strong> to complete the initial handshake! Once you enter the game with the VPN, you will be able to launch without VPN in all future sessions!",
    "faq_on_stuck_tip": "Connecting to a Netherlands, USA, or Japan VPN bypasses ISP blocks 100%. After reaching the game menu the first time, you can play without VPN on future launches.",
