    "faq_off5_q": "5. Antivirus / Private DNS",
    "faq_off5_a": "Disable antivirus and Private DNS. Same issue as Online.",
    "faq_off6_q": "6. VPN (EU recommended)",
    "faq_off6_a": "Some regions need a European VPN even for Offline mode.",
    "faq_off_stuck_q": "Offline update stuck, fails to download, or freezes in Launcher",
    "faq_off_stuck_a": "If trying to update the offline game and it won't work or freezes:<br />1. Open the <strong>Launcher</strong>.<br />2. Go to the <strong>Diagnostics</strong> menu (or look for the <strong>Stop Game Session</strong> button).<br />3. Tap <strong>Stop Game Session</strong>.<br />4. Completely close the launcher (swipe it away from recent apps).<br />5. Reopen the launcher and run the update again. It will now download and install smoothly!",
    "faq_off_stuck_tip": "A background session lock prevents patch files from being written. Stopping the session and restarting the launcher clears the lock immediately.",
