    "upd_on_intro_title": "Routine Updates Happen Automatically In-App (Android & iOS)",
    "upd_on_intro_tip": "<strong>Good to know:</strong> You do <strong>not</strong> need to download a new APK or IPA for every update! Regular patches, new banners, and assets download <strong>automatically inside the game</strong> when launched. You only need to reinstall a new APK/IPA when the developers announce a <strong>major new client build</strong> on Discord.",
    "upd_on_s1_title": "Routine In-App Updates vs. Major Client Builds",
    "upd_on_s1_desc": "<strong>Normal updates:</strong> Just open the game on Wi-Fi — it patches automatically in seconds!<br /><strong>Major updates:</strong> When a new app version is posted on Discord, download the latest <strong>APK (Android)</strong> or <strong>IPA (iOS)</strong> using the buttons below.",
    "upd_on_s2_title": "Install over the existing app (Android & iOS)",
    "upd_on_s2_desc": "Install the new build directly on top of the existing app. <strong>Do NOT uninstall first!</strong><br />• <strong>Android:</strong> Open the new APK → Install anyway.<br />• <strong>iOS:</strong> Sideload the new Online IPA via SideStore or Sideloadly.<br />Your progress is linked to your Discord account on the live server and remains 100% safe.",
    "upd_on_s3_title": "Launch and download patch data",
    "upd_on_s3_desc": "Open the game on Wi-Fi. It will connect to the server and finalize any missing assets. If a Connection Error occurs on first launch, use a free VPN (Netherlands/USA) for the initial handshake.",
    "upd_on_stuck_tip": "<strong>Stuck on loading or Connection Error?</strong> 100% Proven Fix: Use a free VPN (such as <strong>Proton VPN</strong>) connected to <em>Netherlands, USA, or Japan</em>. You only need the VPN the <strong>first time</strong> to complete the initial handshake — once you reach the game menu, you can disconnect the VPN and launch normally without VPN in all future sessions!",
    "upd_offline_h": "Offline Mode (Android) — How to Update (with Save Backup)",
    "upd_off_s1_title": "STEP 1 (OPTIONAL): Back up your save slot",
    "upd_off_s1_desc": "<strong>Optional — only if you already played and have progress to keep:</strong> In game tap Floating Menu → Saves → active slot (Slot 1) → Rename → Export. Save the file in Files / Google Drive.<br /><em>If this is your first time playing or you want to start fresh, ignore this step and go directly to Step 2!</em>",
    "upd_off_s2_title": "Open Launcher → Updates → Beta channel",
    "upd_off_s2_desc": "Open the Launcher (Sage Mode icon) → left-side menu → <strong>Updates</strong>. Make sure the channel is set to <strong>Beta</strong>. Then tap <strong>Check for updates</strong>.",
    "upd_off_s3_title": "Update and Fix",
    "upd_off_s3_desc": "Tap <strong>Update now</strong> and wait. After the launcher reinstalls, reopen it and tap <strong>Fix</strong> to re-download/verify the game files. Play Protect may appear again — always <em>More info</em> → <em>Install anyway</em>.",
    "upd_off_stuck_tip": "<strong>Update stuck or failing?</strong> Open Launcher → Diagnostics menu (or look for <em>Stop Game Session</em>) → tap <strong>Stop Game Session</strong> → completely close the launcher → reopen and run the update again!",
    "upd_off_s4_title": "Restore your save if needed",
    "upd_off_s4_desc": "If your progress is gone after the update: Floating Menu → Saves → tap <strong>Import</strong> → select your exported save file. Your progress will be fully restored.",
    "upd_off_note": "<strong>Note:</strong> After a major update the game may show a new empty save slot. Your old slot should still be importable from the Saves menu.",
