    "oo_online_desc": "Live multiplayer revival experience linked to Discord with active community events, guild play, and real-time PvP.",
    "oo_vanilla_desc": "Authentic nostalgic solo journey from Level 1 with full historical banner access and zero internet connection required.",
    "oo_alldata_desc": "The ultimate ninja sandbox: ALL characters in the game unlocked at MAX level and abilities + 1,000,000 pearls. Designed for testing, theorycrafting, and pure fun without any grinding.",
    "oo_online_pts": "Discord cloud sync across all your devices|Real-time PvP (Ninja World Clash) & live Co-Op|Chronological banner progression (starts 2016 meta)|Global leaderboards & weekly competitive events|Requires constant active internet connection",
    "oo_vanilla_pts": "100% Offline — zero internet or account required|Starts at Level 1 with 1,000 Ninja Pearls|All historical banners from game history open Day 1|Complete solo PvE (Story, Ninja Road, Phantom Castle)|Customizable drop rates via Launcher GAMEPLAY settings|Separate local save slot (won't touch All Data)",
    "oo_alldata_pts": "ALL characters in the game unlocked at MAX level & abilities!|1,000,000 Ninja Pearls for infinite summons & stamina|Ultimate Sandbox: Test new units & theorycraft dream teams|Battle Playground: Jump straight into difficult boss fights|Pure FUN & Nostalgia: Play any ninja without grinding|Separate local save slot (switch back & forth freely)",
